000010* CALL: by reference / content / value, RETURNING, RETURN-CODE,
000020* WORKING-STORAGE kept between calls and reset by CANCEL, CALL
000030* through a data name, a nested program with GLOBAL data, and
000040* ON EXCEPTION for a missing program (END-DISPLAY: without
000050* it, NOT ON EXCEPTION would belong to the DISPLAY.)
000060 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000070 PROGRAM-ID. CALLS.
000080 DATA DIVISION.
000090 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000100 01 TOTAL          PIC 9(4) VALUE 10.
000110 01 EXTRA           PIC 9(4) VALUE 20.
000120 01 PROG-NAME      PIC X(8) VALUE "ADDER".
000130 01 RESULT         PIC S9(9) COMP-5.
000140 01 SHARED         PIC X(10) VALUE "OUTER" GLOBAL.
000150 01 CUSTOMER.
000160    05 CUST-NAME   PIC X(10) VALUE "SMITH".
000170    05 CUST-BAL    PIC S9(5)V99 VALUE 100.50.
000180 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
000190 MAIN-PARA.
000200     CALL "ADDER" USING TOTAL BY CONTENT EXTRA BY VALUE 5
000210     DISPLAY "AFTER 1: " TOTAL " " EXTRA " RC " RETURN-CODE
000220     CALL "ADDER" USING TOTAL EXTRA BY VALUE 1
000230     DISPLAY "AFTER 2: " TOTAL " " EXTRA " RC " RETURN-CODE
000240     CANCEL "ADDER"
000250     CALL PROG-NAME USING TOTAL EXTRA BY VALUE 0
000260     DISPLAY "CANCELED " TOTAL " RC " RETURN-CODE
000270     CALL "SQUARE" USING BY VALUE 12 RETURNING RESULT
000280     DISPLAY "SQUARE   " RESULT
000290     CALL "ACCOUNT" USING CUSTOMER
000300     DISPLAY "ACCOUNT  " CUST-NAME " " CUST-BAL
000310     CALL "INNER" USING TOTAL
000320     DISPLAY "INNER    " TOTAL " " SHARED
000330     CALL "NOSUCHPROG" USING TOTAL
000340        ON EXCEPTION DISPLAY "NOT FOUND, AS EXPECTED" END-DISPLAY
000350        NOT ON EXCEPTION DISPLAY "FOUND?"
000360     END-CALL
000370     CALL "SQUARE" USING BY VALUE 3 RETURNING RESULT
000380        ON EXCEPTION DISPLAY "SQUARE MISSING?" END-DISPLAY
000390        NOT ON EXCEPTION DISPLAY "FOUND    " RESULT
000400     END-CALL
000410     MOVE 0 TO RETURN-CODE
000420     STOP RUN.
000430 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000440 PROGRAM-ID. INNER.
000450 DATA DIVISION.
000460 LINKAGE SECTION.
000470 01 N              PIC 9(4).
000480 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING N.
000490     ADD 1000 TO N
000500     MOVE "CHANGED" TO SHARED
000510     EXIT PROGRAM.
000520 END PROGRAM INNER.
000530 END PROGRAM CALLS.
